<title>USA: N.C. says to sell $450 mln school bonds on March 5.</title>
<headline>N.C. says to sell $450 mln school bonds on March 5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Carolina officials said Friday they plan to sell $450 million public school building bonds, series 1997A, in a competitive sale set for March 5.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
